# ─── Agent working documents ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Planning, specs, and research live on disk but are not part of the published
# project. ARCHITECTURE.md is the committed spec; everything here is scaffolding
# around it. See CLAUDE.md.
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md
/docs/agent/
.claude/

# ─── Vendored native artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Fetched by scripts/fetch-native.sh with pinned SHA-256 checksums. Never
# committed: they are large, and a binary blob in an AGPL tree is a licensing
# and supply-chain liability (ARCHITECTURE.md §10.7).
/core/xray/libs/*.aar
/service/src/main/jniLibs/
/.native-cache/

# ─── Gradle / Android ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.iml
.gradle/
build/
captures/
local.properties
.cxx/
release/
# Kotlin Gradle Plugin's build-session/incremental-compilation cache, written
# at the repo root since Kotlin 1.8.20 regardless of which module is built.
# Pure build scratch, same category as .gradle/ and build/ above.
.kotlin/

# ─── IDE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/*
!.idea/codeStyles/
!.idea/inspectionProfiles/

# ─── Signing ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A leaked upload key is unrecoverable, and it is the identity F-Droid,
# IzzyOnDroid, and the HWID scheme (ARCHITECTURE.md §A.4.1) all key off.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties

# ─── OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
